    "solution": "From the original floor, cut upward to position and charge the floating seed. Dash through the prism to invert the room, then jump left onto the stable tooth beside the prepared seed. A leftward blade strike throws you right through the thorn-lined passage. Carry that burst into a horizontal dash near the middle of the crossing to reach the farther receiving ceiling. Land and walk out. The seed keeps its position relative to the architecture while gravity changes the floor from which you can reach its useful side.",
    "nearestExisting": "B36 places a launch beside a portal, F36 revisits a seed from its other side, and B14 uses inversion to deliver cargo. Here gravity changes access to a seed that must retain the correct absolute height for a thorn-lined launch opening.",
